body:
I came across an issue with one of our big projects, when I was bundling an AMD module. The module will be used by another project which already uses these external dependencies.

External dependencies does not become a part of the define dependency array if the external dependency is not a part of the main entry point dependencies. Leading to `Uncaught ReferenceError: __WEBPACK_EXTERNAL_MODULE_X__ is not defined`

I have created a simple project which displays this issue below

Example:
https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test

[`webpack-config.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/webpack-config.js)

``` javascript
var config = {
    context: './src',
    entry: {
        main1: 'main1.js',
        main2: 'main2.js'
    },
    output: {
        filename: '[name].bundle.js',
        path: './dist',
        publicPath: 'dist/',
        libraryTarget: 'amd'
    },
    externals: {
        jquery: 'jquery',
        backbone: 'backbone',
        underscore: 'underscore'
    },
    resolve: {
        root: './src'
    }
};

module.exports = config;
```

[`src/main2.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/src/main2.js)

``` javascript
define(['underscore'], function(_) {
    console.log('main2 loaded');

    return function() {
        require(['modules/other2'], function(other) {
            console.log('other from main2 loaded');
            alert('main2 loaded, result from other: ' + other());
        });
    }
});
```

[`src/modules/other2.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/src/modules/other2.js)

``` javascript
define(['jquery', 'backbone'], function($, Backbone) {
    return function() {
        return 10;
    }
});
```

This fails on runtime, because [`src/modules/other2.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/src/modules/other2.js)'s external dependencies cannot be loaded. If however the `other2` dependency becomes a part of the entry point's define dependency array, it works fine:

[`src/main1.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/src/main1.js)

``` javascript
define(['underscore', 'modules/other'], function(_, other) {
    console.log('main1 loaded');
    console.log('other from main1 loaded');

    return function() {
        alert('main1 loaded, result from other: ' + other());
    }
});
```

[`src/modules/other.js`](https://github.com/thebreiflabb/webpack-amd-test/blob/master/src/modules/other.js)

``` javascript
define(['jquery'], function($) {
    return function() {
        return 3;
    }
});
```
